{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6e6e44ea-b1a3-4d45-8df3-2fcbb30240cd",
    "name": "Flowsdone Ecosystem - API Gateway",
    "description": "Colección de todos los endpoints del api_gateway: admin (tenants/proyectos/agentes/workflows/canales), webhooks por canal (Facebook, Instagram, X, WhatsApp, Telegram, TikTok), webhook genérico (n8n/RabbitMQ) y el callback interno de outbound.\n\nUsá el environment \"Flowsdone - Local\" o \"Flowsdone - Producción\" (variable `baseUrl` + secrets). En producción tenés que cargar los secrets vos mismo en el environment (quedan vacíos a propósito, nunca se commitean valores reales).\n\nOrden recomendado para correr todo de punta a punta (Collection Runner): Admin - Tenants > Admin - Projects > Admin - Agents > Admin - Channel Apps > Admin - Channel Connections > Webhooks - *. Las requests de \"Create\" guardan el id devuelto en variables del environment (tenantId, projectId, agentId, channelConnectionId) para que las siguientes ya las usen solas.\n\nNo incluye el WebSocket /ws (el soporte de WS de Postman varía según versión/cliente) — para probar el webchat interactivo usá `{{baseUrl}}/static/webchat/` en el navegador.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "X-Admin-Api-Key", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "{{adminApiKey}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Admin - Tenants",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Tenant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('tenantId', json.id);",
                  "    console.log('tenantId guardado:', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Acme Corp\",\n  \"slug\": \"acme\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/internal/admin/tenants",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "admin", "tenants"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Tenants",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/internal/admin/tenants",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "admin", "tenants"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Tenant",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/internal/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "admin", "tenants", "{{tenantId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Tenant",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
