    {
      "name": "Admin - Channel Apps",
      "description": "App compartida por proveedor (meta cubre Facebook+Instagram, twitter, tiktok) — una sola fila por proveedor para todo el SaaS. Ver README sección 9.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upsert Channel App - meta",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"credentials\": {\n    \"app_secret\": \"{{metaAppSecret}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "description": "webhook_verify_token no se manda: UpsertChannelAppUseCase lo autogenera si falta (y preserva el existente en updates). Corré 'Reveal Channel App Credentials - meta' después para recuperarlo.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/internal/admin/channel-apps/meta",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "admin", "channel-apps", "meta"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reveal Channel App Credentials - meta",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('metaWebhookVerifyToken', pm.response.json().credentials.webhook_verify_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "description": "Devuelve credentials en texto plano (a diferencia de Get Channel App). Guarda automáticamente webhook_verify_token en la variable de entorno para pegarlo en el panel de Meta y para que 'Webhooks - Facebook/Instagram > GET Verify' lo use.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/internal/admin/channel-apps/meta/credentials",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "admin", "channel-apps", "meta", "credentials"]
            }
          }
        },
